{title: Sairat Zala Ji}
{artist: Ajay Atul Sairat}
{key: Am}

{c: Verse 1}
[Am] Alguj Vaaj Na [F] bhaat,        [F] Bhaltach Jhalaya [E] Aaj
[Am] Algad Aali Ma [F] naat,        [F] Pahilich Tarani Hee [E] Laaj
Aga [E] Jhananal Ka [E] lajamandi,        Ann [E] Hatamandi Haat Aal Ji
Sairat Zaala [F] ji... [E],        Sairat Zaala [F] ji.... [E]
Sairat Zaala [Am] ji,        [Am] Badlun Gelaya [F] Saar
[F] Peertich Sutlaya [E] Vara,        [Am] Alad Bhambhaval [F] yala
[F] Billuri Pakharu [E] Nyara,        Aala [E] Manaatl Hya Hoa [E] tamandhi
Ann [E] Hatamandi Haat Aal Ji,        Sairat Zaala [F] ji... [E] ....
Sairat Zaala [F] ji.... [E] ....        Sairat Zaala [Am] ji
[E] Kavalya [Am] Paanat Hya,        [E] Savlya [Am] Unhaat Hya
