[E] Ghumataay [Am] Kanamandhi,        [E] Sur Sana [Am] icha Raaya [E] Sajal
Hey Saja [C] la Unh Vara Nabh [G] Tara Sajala
Ranga [C] la Maan Haldi Ne [E] Raani Rangal,        Sara [C] l Hey Jagnyach [G] Jhuran Saral
Bhina [C] la Najran Esh [E] chari Bhinal,        Aag [E] Dhadadal Hya [E] Nabhamandi
An [E] Dholasang Gaat Aal Ji,        Sairat Zaala [F] ji... [E] ....
Sairat Zaala [F] ji.... [E] ....        Sairat Zaala [Am] ji
[E] Aakarit [Am] Ghadlaya,        [E] Sapaan Hey [Am] Padlaya
[E] Galayamandi [Am] Sajlaya [E] Doral Doral,        [E] Saata Jan [Am] mach Naat
[E] Rujalaya [Am] Kaaljat,        [E] Tula ra [Am] Devagat [E] Pujal
Ruja [C] la Bij Peertich [G] Sajani Rujal,        Bhija [C] l Maan Pirmana [E] Purta Bhijal
Sara [C] la Funn Maarun [G] Jagan Sarala,        Hara [C] la Hya Pirmala [E] Samad Harala
Aaag [E] Kadalal Paava [E] samandi,        Ann [E] Abhalal Yaat Aal Ji
